---
id: fried-eggs-ham-toast
title: Fried Eggs with Ham and Toast
category: breakfast

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 260

storage:
  fridge_days: 1
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Toast @sprouted-power-bread{1%slice} in a #toaster until golden.

Heat a #skillet over medium-high heat. Sear @cooked-ham-sliced{2%slice} for ~sear{1%minute} per side until lightly browned. Transfer to a plate.

Lower the heat to medium and melt @unsalted-butter{5%g} in the skillet. Crack in @eggs{3%count}, season with a pinch of salt and pepper, and cook sunny-side up for ~fry{3%minute} until the whites are set and the yolks remain liquid.

Slide the eggs alongside the ham and toast. Serve immediately.
